<item>
<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-10-25T12:40:45.214Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 12:40:45 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi rebels have continued to launch missiles and drones at Saudi oil facilities, airports and Riyadh, with Saudi forces intercepting several projectiles and downing a missile aimed at the capital. Saudi Arabia has reopened Riyadh Airport after weeks of Houthi attacks, while the coalition reports shooting down two missiles in recent strikes. Egypt expressed caution about becoming involved in the Yemen conflict, and Jordan’s King Abdullah ordered a firm response after a deadly church attack linked to the broader regional tensions. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261024-yemen-s-houthi-rebels-claim-new-attacks-on-oil-facilities-and-airports-across-saudi-arabia&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/25/world/middleeast/saudi-arabia-riyadh-airport-reopens.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxOTTBPeHdXLTl1YmNHdnJLbzEwclU4aUpsQ01IV2Z0NG1xcDR6WWwzaVRVZURzQ2M0VERFcnE0S29YWTFnOXJYVjVWRDF5d2tqQVU4ZVVHRTRxVTBpQVhVR0tWQUFNelRHeU5qZ3JJbEU2STVQS0p6aDI1anJ4NkdvbEFIWEZhZkx1SXI2cWJIZGZNMU0xSExaSzB2amtFU3czSUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxOanFHRmV4LTNER1VUS1RMVUI0T015WUdfVkFIb2ZONGR0VDA3c09fM3hEd3FIRDgxU1NVQUNLUFJ2ZXRtMXhISVZSX1pXMVRRbnY5U3VaM3JoNkRSQWJISHV2OHh2TlJQY1pEWXNhZWdSQkMwbjRaVXNKS0Q2eEE0WEo1cnVteWQ0VkV0NHM1UXpnbllTV3FtbnhlTXNHR3dmZVdvQ3NvX055WmFZZHFsLW9NRERhem5icVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;